RefineUI is the unified design system for Pelagornis products. Foundation variables become `@refineui/tokens`. UI is `@refineui/react`. The Web Kit you design against is the React you ship.

## Architecture

- **[Foundations](/foundations/)** — Visual language, design tokens, and layout
- **[Components](/components/)** — Actions, Forms, Navigation, Feedback, Overlays, Data Display, Content, Layout
- **[Development](/development/)** — Installation, theming, and motion in product code
- **[AI & Tools](/ai-tools/)** — DESIGN.md, llms.txt, Skill, Doctor, MCP

